# Scholars Fear Humanities Endowment Is Being Dumbed Down.

**Authors:** Southwick, Ron

## Abstract
Reports concerns of scholars that the National Endowment for the Humanities is increasing support for many popular programs while decreasing or eliminating support for projects that involve the editing of important scholarly papers. Notes congressional support for the Endowment's current policy including its emphasis on fund raising by grant recipients. (DB) (DB)

